<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">加载中…</view>

  <block wx:if="{{!loading && inv}}">
    <view class="hero">
      <view class="hero-title">邀请进度</view>
      <view class="progress-num"><text class="big">{{inv.validCount}}</text> / {{inv.target}} 人</view>
      <view class="progress-bar"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{percent}}%"></view></view>
      <view class="hero-status">
        <text wx:if="{{inv.status === 'locked'}}" class="badge-green">已达标 · 佣金发放中</text>
        <text wx:elif="{{inv.status === 'void'}}" class="badge-gray">邀请已失效 · 订单已取消</text>
        <text wx:else class="badge-gray">累计中 · 还差 {{inv.target - inv.validCount}} 人</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="section-title">我的邀请码</view>
      <view class="code-box" bindtap="copyCode">
        <text class="code">{{inv.code}}</text>
        <text class="copy">点击复制</text>
      </view>
      <view class="link-box" bindtap="copyLink">带参邀请路径：{{path}}</view>
      <view class="hint">分享给好友，通过邀请码下单并支付即计入有效邀请（按账号去重）</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="row"><text>预计佣金</text><text class="green">¥ {{inv.amountYuan}}</text></view>
      <view class="row"><text>邀请截止</text><text>{{inv.inviteDeadline}}</text></view>
      <view class="row" wx:if="{{commission}}"><text>发放状态</text><text class="green">{{commission.status === 'paid' ? '已到账' : commission.status === 'exception' ? '异常待处理' : commission.status === 'void' ? '已作废' : '待发放'}}</text></view>
      <view class="row" wx:if="{{inv.shortfall}}"><text>规则提示</text><text class="warn">有受邀订单已取消</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="notice">佣金以原订单实付款原路退款实现，微信支付账单可能显示退款。仅展示汇总人数，保护受邀人身份。退款由运营统一处理，到账后状态会变为「已到账」。</view>
    <view class="link-orders" bindtap="goOrders">查看我的订单 →</view>
  </block>
</view>
